window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>I achieve everything I set my mind to.</p> <p>Escape my childhood circumstances and come out on top? Check.</p> <p>Become one of the most powerful billionaires on Wall Street? Check.</p> <p>Meet the picture-perfect woman and make her my wife? Well, I might've hit a snag on that one.</p> <p>When an angry, curvy redhead crashes my blind date, I should just forget her and move on. After all, she's the opposite of what I'm looking for: quirky, awkward, and completely uncharmed by my riches.</p> <p>Wait, and she has how many cats?</p> <p>Problem is, I've never wanted anything as badly as I do her.</p> <p>Making Emma mine might be my greatest challenge yet, but I have no intention of giving up. Right woman or not, I need the stubborn redhead in my life, and I'm willing to pull out all the stops.</p> <p>Kitten, it's game on!</p>"; 
